---
// src/pages/liability.astro
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Content & Legal Liability Agreement | Web Harbor Solutions"
  description="Disclosure defining client responsibility for website copy, regulatory compliance, licensing, and published claims."
  canonical="https://webharborsolutions.com/liability/"
>
  <main class="py-16 md:py-24 relative z-10">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-slate-900/80 p-8 sm:p-14 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-card backdrop-blur-md space-y-8">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-accent-blue dark:text-blue-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Legal Responsibility &amp; Indemnity</span>
          <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-primary-dark dark:text-slate-50 mt-1 font-display">Client Content &amp; Liability Agreement</h1>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-2">Last Updated: October 2026 • Published Claims, Licensing &amp; Warranty Guidelines</p>
        </div>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary-dark dark:text-slate-50 font-display">1. Content Accuracy &amp; Client Warranty</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            The Client explicitly affirms and warrants that all commercial claims, pricing figures, licensing credentials, business certifications, warranties, trade hours, photos, and branding assets supplied or approved for publication on the website are true, accurate, up to date, and lawfully owned or licensed by the Client.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary-dark dark:text-slate-50 font-display">2. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Web Harbor Solutions functions solely as an engineering design, development, and hosting infrastructure provider. Under no circumstances shall Web Harbor Solutions, its operating team, officers, or technical contractors be held legally or financially liable for damages, claims, regulatory enforcement actions, or loss of revenue resulting from:
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed list-disc list-inside">
            <li>Inaccurate or misleading service pricing, guarantees, or descriptions published at the Client's instruction.</li>
            <li>Failure of the Client to maintain active trade licenses, state certifications, or mandated local insurance coverage.</li>
            <li>Copyright, trademark, or intellectual property disputes regarding client-submitted logos, slogans, or imagery.</li>
            <li>Third-party network outages or unforeseen DNS registry interruptions outside of Cloudflare's core control.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary-dark dark:text-slate-50 font-display">3. Trade Compliance &amp; Consumer Protection</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Client is solely responsible for ensuring their advertised services comply with all municipal, state, federal, and national trade laws (including EPA regulations for HVAC contractors, plumbing codes, health department standards for food establishments, and state licensing boards for clinical practitioners). Web Harbor Solutions will immediately remove or correct any published claim upon written notice of regulatory non-compliance.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary-dark dark:text-slate-50 font-display">4. Mutual Indemnification</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Client agrees to indemnify, defend, and hold harmless Web Harbor Solutions, its operating team, directors, and personnel against any and all claims, liabilities, losses, costs, or legal defense expenses arising from third-party actions regarding commercial services or goods sold by Client through or in connection with the website.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary-dark dark:text-slate-50 font-display">5. Notice &amp; Takedown Procedure</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            If you believe content hosted on a Web Harbor Solutions client domain infringes upon copyright or violates consumer truth-in-advertising statutes, please contact our compliance team directly at:
          </p>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50/70 dark:bg-slate-950/70 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <p><strong class="text-primary-dark dark:text-slate-100">Web Harbor Solutions Compliance</strong></p>
            <p>Email: <a href="mailto:webharborsolutions@gmail.com" class="text-accent-teal hover:underline font-semibold">webharborsolutions@gmail.com</a></p>
            <p>Guaranteed Technical Response: Within 24 business hours</p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
